Daeva.app includes the following third-party components.

Wine (winecx-gptk 4.7.903-daeva)
  LGPL-2.1-or-later
  Source: https://github.com/nachtlamb/winecx (branch daeva/steamclient-trampolines)
          https://github.com/nachtlamb/winecx-gptk (branch daeva/v4.7.3-steamclient)

steam.exe, a port of Proton's steam_helper from NotProton
  BSD-3-Clause, see steam-shim-BSD-3.txt
  Source: https://github.com/NotProtonNot/NotProton

compat_cpuid.dylib (aion2-wine-compat, commit 7ecbdef)
  MIT, see aion2-wine-compat-MIT.txt
  Source: https://github.com/Yuki-fox/aion2-wine-compat

Python 3.13 (python-build-standalone 20261003)
  PSF-2.0, see python/lib/python3.13/LICENSE.txt in the app bundle

D3DMetal, Valve's Steam client libraries and NotProton's Steam Play dylib are not
included. They are fetched or imported on the user's machine during setup.
